WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.810
Tonight: «ce soir».

2
00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:05.100
Tomorrow: «demain». Later: «plus tard».

3
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.760
Plans, weekends, holidays, ambitions.

4
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:12.280
So much of what you want
to say lives in the future.

5
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:15.030
You could wait until you've
learnt a whole new tense.

6
00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.810
But French has a shortcut,

7
00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:19.690
and it's built from a
verb you already know.

8
00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:21.820
Which verb is it, and how does it carry

9
00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.470
you into the future?

10
00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:26.140
In this mission, you'll
meet a little train that can

11
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:28.730
carry any plan into tomorrow.

12
00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:31.390
Then you'll build plans of
your own from word chips,

13
00:00:31.390 --> 00:00:32.960
and check each one.

14
00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:36.160
Your mission: find out
how to talk about tonight,

15
00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:39.810
tomorrow and next year with
a verb you already know.
